@startuml git-support-state
title Git Support v1 — Per-file Conflict Lifecycle

[*] --> Unresolved : merge/rebase leaves\nindex conflict entry

Unresolved --> Reviewing : user selects path\nin Conflicts list
Reviewing --> Reviewing : Accept Ours / Accept Theirs /\nhand-edit Result

Reviewing --> Unresolved : user selects a\ndifferent conflicted path\n(no write happens)

Reviewing --> Resolved : Mark Resolved\n(resolve_conflict succeeds)

Resolved --> [*] : path no longer in\nconflicts() — user commits\nexternally to finish the merge

Reviewing --> Reviewing : resolve_conflict fails\n(PathEscapesRepo / io error)\n— error shown, stays in Reviewing

@enduml
